# To the Forsaken Mines in Bastok Markets. The login plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in 22 (that mission's event,
# not this one's). Cleades' own 1001; option 0 nothing, option 11 begins (YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION); Cleades 1002 twice; a
# Pickaxe, a Glocolite with a Pickaxe: nothing; the Glocolite: 1010, whose finish completes the mission (400 rank
# points) and takes it.
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1006 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1010 BastokMines/Davyad/onTrigger BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/Rashid/onTrade BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/onEventFinish/1006 BastokMines/onEventFinish/1010 Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Malduc/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1006 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1010 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/Argus/onTrade PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/onEventFinish/1006 PortBastok/onEventFinish/1010 GusgenMines/qm2/onTrigger GusgenMines/qm2/onTrade
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers completed
item Glocolite
item Pickaxe
login
trigger Cleades                            # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 11: nothing
trigger Cleades
finish option=11                        # begun
trigger Cleades                            # 1002
finish-if-event

trigger Cleades
finish-if-event
trade Cleades Pickaxe x1                   # not the Glocolite: nothing
trade Cleades Glocolite x1 Pickaxe x1      # not the Glocolite alone: nothing
trade Cleades Glocolite x1                 # first time: 1010
finish                                  # completed (400 rank points), the Glocolite taken
